{"id":"07ee726a6e15b274","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md","title":"Affine Algebraic Group","display":"df-algebraic-group — Affine Algebraic Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-group","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-group","Affine Algebraic Group"],"display":"df-algebraic-group — Affine Algebraic Group","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-variety.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-group</span><span>Affine Algebraic Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-group — Affine Algebraic Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"621e8d7c1c15f553\" href=\"?note=621e8d7c1c15f553\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-variety.md\">../batch16/58-df-variety.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" href=\"?note=71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (a designated field structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in V\">\\(G\\in V\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\subseteq (G\\times G)\\times G\">\\(m\\subseteq (G\\times G)\\times G\\)</span> (multiplication graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\subseteq G\\times G\">\\(i\\subseteq G\\times G\\)</span> (inverse graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in G\">\\(e\\in G\\)</span> (identity element)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\\)</span> (structured affine-variety predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"621e8d7c1c15f553\" href=\"?note=621e8d7c1c15f553\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-variety.md\">../batch16/58-df-variety.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}\\)</span> (polynomial evaluation for the designated field structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" href=\"?note=71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md\">../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\\)</span> (structured affine regular-map predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k\\)</span> (explicit and compatibility predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}regular\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\n(f,X,Y;k,n,r,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land X\\subseteq k^n\\land Y\\subseteq k^r\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists p\\in k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]^r\\;\\forall a\\in X\\;\nf(a)=\\langle\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(p(j),a)\\mid j\\in r\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}regular\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\n(f,X,Y;k,n,r,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land X\\subseteq k^n\\land Y\\subseteq k^r\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists p\\in k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]^r\\;\\forall a\\in X\\;\nf(a)=\\langle\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(p(j),a)\\mid j\\in r\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}group\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S(G,m,i,e;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(G;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,G\\times G,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,G,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\n(i,G,G;k,n,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists p\\in k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{2n-1}]^n\\;\\forall a,b\\in G\\;\nm(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n=\\langle\\operatorname{ev}_{k,2n}(p(j),a\\mathbin{\\frown}b)\\mid j\\in n\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land e\\in G\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in G\\;\nm(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)\n=m(\\langle x,m(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;\\bigl(\nm(\\langle e,x\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\n\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\land m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}group\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S(G,m,i,e;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(G;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,G\\times G,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,G,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{AffineRegularMap}_S\n(i,G,G;k,n,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists p\\in k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{2n-1}]^n\\;\\forall a,b\\in G\\;\nm(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n=\\langle\\operatorname{ev}_{k,2n}(p(j),a\\mathbin{\\frown}b)\\mid j\\in n\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land e\\in G\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in G\\;\nm(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)\n=m(\\langle x,m(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;\\bigl(\nm(\\langle e,x\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\n\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\land m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}group\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S(G,m,i,e;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}group\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_S(G,m,i,e;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All variety and regularity clauses use one designated field structure. Multiplication is evaluated on the concatenated coordinate tuple <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mathbin{\\frown}b\\in k^{2n}\">\\(a\\mathbin{\\frown}b\\in k^{2n}\\)</span>; the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\)</span> is not incorrectly identified with a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2n\">\\(2n\\)</span>-tuple.</li>\n<li>Algebraic group: variety that is a group; combines algebraic geometry and group theory.</li>\n<li>Examples include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}_n(k)\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}_n(k)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SL}_n(k)\">\\(\\mathrm{SL}_n(k)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb G_m\">\\(\\mathbb G_m\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Affine algebraic groups correspond contravariantly to commutative Hopf algebras.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Springer, Linear Algebraic Groups</li>\n<li>Humphreys, Linear Algebraic Groups</li>\n<li>Borel, Linear Algebraic Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-variety.md","status":"re